# Build outputs that are copies of dist/.
#
# NOTE: dist/ itself IS tracked, deliberately — the deploy Worker publishes
# files out of a git commit, so untracking it would ship nothing. See README.
# These are the redundant copies: a zip of dist/index.html is a second thing
# to remember to rebuild, and the only way it can differ is by being stale.
deploy/index.html
dist/mcl64.html
mcl64.zip
mcl64-deploy.zip
mcl64-deploy/

# Local editor / tooling config
.claude/

# Local scratch
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
